[
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P1-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P1-S1",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "It is said that in England death is pressing, in Canada inevitable and in California optional. Small wonder.",
    "translation": "据说，死亡在英国是紧迫的，在加拿大是不可避免的，而在加利福尼亚是可选的。没什么奇怪的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P1-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P1-S2",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Americans' life expectancy has nearly doubled over the past century.",
    "translation": "在过去的一个世纪里，美国人的预期寿命几乎翻了一番。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P1-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P1-S3",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Failing hips can be replaced, clinical depression controlled, cataracts removed in a 30-minute surgical procedure.",
    "translation": "在 30 分钟的手术过程中，可以更换失效的髋关节、控制临床抑郁症、去除白内障。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P1-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P1-S4",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Such advances offer the aging population a quality of life that was unimaginable when I entered medicine 50 years ago.",
    "translation": "这些进步为老龄化人口提供了50年前我进入医学界时难以想象的生活质量。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P1-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P1-S5",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "But not even a great health-care system can cure death—and our failure to confront that reality now threatens this greatness of ours.",
    "translation": "但即使是一个伟大的医疗保健系统也无法治愈死亡——而我们未能面对这一现实，现在威胁着我们的伟大。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P1-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P1-S6",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Death is normal; we are genetically programmed to disintegrate and perish, even under ideal conditions.",
    "translation": "死亡是正常的；即使在理想的条件下，我们的基因也注定会瓦解和灭亡。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P1-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P1-S7",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "We all understand that at some level, yet as medical consumers we treat death as a problem to be solved.",
    "translation": "我们都明白，在某种程度上，但作为医疗消费者，我们将死亡视为一个需要解决的问题。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 8,
      "ps": "P1-S8"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 8,
      "id": "P1-S8",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Shielded by third-party payers from the cost of our care, we demand everything that can possibly be done for us, even if it's useless.",
    "translation": "由于第三方支付者保护我们免于支付护理费用，我们要求为我们做一切可能的事情，即使它是无用的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P2-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P2-S1",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "The most obvious example is late-stage cancer care.",
    "translation": "最明显的例子是晚期癌症护理。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P2-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P2-S2",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Physicians—frustrated by their inability to cure the disease and fearing loss of hope in the patient—too often offer aggressive treatment far beyond what is scientifically justified.",
    "translation": "医生们因无法治愈疾病而感到沮丧，并担心患者失去希望，常常提供远远超出科学合理范围的积极治疗。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P2-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P2-S3",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "In 1950, the US spent $12.7 billion on health care.",
    "translation": "1950年，美国在医疗保健上的支出为127亿美元。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P2-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P2-S4",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "In 2002, the cost will be $1,540 billion.",
    "translation": "2002年，费用将达到15,400亿美元。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P2-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P2-S5",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Anyone can see this trend is unsustainable.",
    "translation": "任何人都可以看出这种趋势是不可持续的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P2-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P2-S6",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Yet few seem willing to try to reverse it.",
    "translation": "然而似乎很少有人愿意尝试扭转这一局面。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P2-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P2-S7",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Some scholars conclude that a government with finite resources should simply stop paying for medical care that sustains life beyond a certain age—say 83 or so.",
    "translation": "一些学者的结论是，资源有限的政府应该停止支付维持生命超过一定年龄（例如 83 岁左右）的医疗费用。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 8,
      "ps": "P2-S8"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 8,
      "id": "P2-S8",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Former Colorado governor Richard Lamm has been quoted as saying that the old and infirm \"have a duty to die and get out of the way\", so that younger, healthier people can realize their potential. I would not go that far.",
    "translation": "前科罗拉多州州长理查德·拉姆曾被引述说，年老体弱的人“有责任死去并离开”，以便更年轻、更健康的人能够发挥他们的潜力。我不会走那么远。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P3-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P3-S1",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Energetic people now routinely work through their 60s and beyond, and remain dazzlingly productive.",
    "translation": "现在，精力充沛的人们通常会工作到 60 多岁甚至更久，并且仍然保持着令人眼花缭乱的生产力。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P3-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P3-S2",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "At 78, Viacom chairman Sumner Redstone jokingly claims to be 53.",
    "translation": "78 岁的维亚康姆董事长萨姆纳·雷石东开玩笑地声称自己 53 岁。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P3-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P3-S3",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Supreme Court Justice Sandra Day O'Connor is in her 70s, and former surgeon general C.",
    "translation": "最高法院法官桑德拉·戴·奥康纳 (Sandra Day O'Connor) 已经 70 多岁了，前卫生局局长 C.",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P3-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P3-S4",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Everett Koop chairs an Internet start-up in his 80s.These leaders are living proof that prevention works and that we can manage the health problems that come naturally with age.",
    "translation": "80 多岁的埃弗雷特·库普 (Everett Koop) 是一家互联网初创公司的董事长。这些领导人是预防工作有效的活生生证明，也证明我们可以应对随着年龄增长而自然出现的健康问题。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
